option.info10.comment=EminGT：Complementary 的主要开发者。Capt Tatsu：BSL Shaders 的开发者，他的慷慨才让 Complementary 得以诞生。特别感谢：IMS212, sp614x, Chocapic13, Robobo1221, SixthSurge, null511, fayer3, catlikecoding, Builderb0y, Jessie, SpacEagle17, isuewo, flytrap, gri573, FoZy-STYLE, plazmal

